@ 0 4 0 0c7ef3b75c36d49a07f77955b44efc2d
+ entry .Memory   a count of bytes, as a quantity: `4.kib`, `data.bytes`
+     `Memory` is the opaque type `rudiments.internal.Memory`, an opaque `Long`, exported here.
+     Arithmetic and comparison treat it as a quantity: two `Memory` add and subtract, a `Memory`
+     multiplies and divides by an `Int`, and one `Memory` divided by another is a `Double`

