+ entry .b   `n.b`: a `Memory` of `n` bytes, on an `Int` or `Long`
+ entry .kib   `n.kib`: a `Memory` of `n` kibibytes (×1024)
+ entry .mib   `n.mib`: a `Memory` of `n` mebibytes (×1024²)
+ entry .gib   `n.gib`: a `Memory` of `n` gibibytes (×1024³)
+ entry .tib   `n.tib`: a `Memory` of `n` tebibytes (×1024⁴)
+ entry .bytes   `data.bytes`: the length of a `Data` as a `Memory`

